  "prompt": "/unslop this, reply with only the rewritten text:\n\nGreat question! Certainly, I can explain. In order to rotate the API key, you need to open Settings > Keys. Due to the fact that old keys stay valid for 24 hours, it is important to note that you could potentially possibly see both keys working for a while. Rotation takes about 5 minutes. The future looks bright for key management. I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any other questions.",
